<title>SINGAPORE: Bangladesh tenders to sell 85,000/bbl Feb naphtha.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh tenders to sell 85,000/bbl Feb naphtha.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Bangladesh Petroleum Corp has tendered to sell 85,000 barrels of naphtha lifting February 16-18 from Chittagong, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The tender closes January 30.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3086)</p>
</text>
